                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na biashara yake na ujira wake utakuwa wakfu kwa BWANA, hautawekwa hazinani wala hautawekwa akiba; bali mapato ya biashara yake yatakuwa mali zao wakaao mbele za BWANA, wapate kula na kushiba, na kuvaa mavazi ya fahari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.18",
